id: high-speed-mark
name: High Speed
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: what High Speed Ace's (2) gives, till the end of the Combat Round.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  High Speed Ace: Wound Rolls 1(T) higher until the end of this Combat Round.
text: >
  High Speed Ace (2): During this Combat Round, if you have moved a total number of Squares that matches or exceeds your Normal Speed through your own effects or Maneuvers, increase your Wound Rolls by 1(T) until the end of this Combat Round.

---

[passive]
wound += 1(T);
